{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1326,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a76b194375da002812f08a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的魔女住在太阳上。\r\n她会用温暖的魔法让花盛开！\r\n你原本不知道吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "362922be48d67e3b72492d41e6e24e13c2603d5518f21c99c42c4155025da2b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19131e351a5c088ffd3bdd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜～早知道就先让祖母\r\n教我能驱散热气的咒语，\r\n或是能做出冰块的咒语……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e2e6d0a2b6c93b58bbcb6c573172d91fd6bc59d68cf81967a6892be3b7987c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5965412620ae2fd8e66bff8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就会想到魔法！\r\n我要施展祖母亲自传授我的\r\n烤番薯魔法，你也一起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a138bff25344ce44a8b4dbbe310501468a4dc5eb30513027e7ecbbd68c63095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff0745c0462da8a5b4f1ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天禁止在外面训练～！\r\n天气太冷了，\r\n就连热呼呼的暖暖包魔法也会失效！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f9ae18de2c91897f6ca75c40229fed37b61fc1fc4233ed561076e81ea20262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37963a236c5719c3285b1552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見て見て！ドレス、とってもキレイ\r\nに着られたわ！すごいでしょ～！\r\nアタシはなんでもできるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50fe9320ea6982e94734623dea9235616f02fefa045b53f84e7f0d3c1988c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc744f8f234f58f084d2bac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら、朝食にポーション作ったの！\r\n今回は上手くいったはずよ！\r\nなによその顔…早く飲んでってば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baaac932c6f8c5cb3b1e3286894b636f1ac10ffaa4c5926aaafa6aa19eb8a47e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55023cf35349b97b95a32119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "も～！スープがドレスに跳ねた～！\r\nなんとかしてってば～！\r\n落ちなかったら使い魔のせいよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7674b17bbce7efff35b8274daa7daf8b184a4ee0760924cb86cd0ec714fb8440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89bc5a0298d0bdc8f98d17cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ふわぁ…お腹いっぱいでも、眠く\r\nならない魔法をかけたわ…んん…\r\nきっと…効くんだから…ぐぅ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2d0e09b9c0077a9cef50525f7469ad8a0fef3397697acef5702a16d12f3ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54bafd3ff8348f88c023fb48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好きな夢を見る魔法を覚えたわ！\r\nだから、箒で空も飛び放題よ！絶対\r\nお月さまに触ってやるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba689db8bb720a725eaaa8fc641af4402903c6383bb88e59315e685412d39d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb88dac9ff3847d73206ad0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "い～や～だ～！今日はこれ着たまま\r\n寝るの～！夜はパジャマじゃなきゃ\r\nダメなんて、だれが決めたのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c697cb4cff00e2f0473f031a552b5cb765e70cc45553c9c5937fbfd66b1aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0c06475ea4a1622877caa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春はお花が咲くから、薬草には\r\n困らないわね！いっぱい摘むから\r\nアンタも手伝いなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69719e8fdf5c630e8f9d4a8e6319359ba983b759dca3f695849f14b30cd31810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2a1f7981e506fc71e89130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ～つ～い～！もっと涼しいとこで\r\n過ごしたいわ！学園を北海道に\r\n瞬間移動させる魔法とかないの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786ffb19ad0bdf8429951a3284df5059c12b18a609d6e9725adef8dd4ebdeef5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587e89db8764d1634915b4fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋だから、いっぱい本を借りたの。\r\nぜんぶ読んだのよ、偉いでしょ？\r\n使い魔、あとで返しておいて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcbf97179b8f93405f323bd40e7e972309423fbb57eb306b7dd73a506e8a3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a63f8b60479216b0d2bcbdd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ねえ、使い魔。アンタが着てる\r\n上着、とっても暖かそうね？…もう\r\nわかるでしょ？ね？わかるわよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "97827952cb8548014d5bccf85be889af9ec7f2b249a660cf813b4d67048b7bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc4df3f10aa419a135ce523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节，快乐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14bd99f4b61734a62b52cc1ca27b2d609a659b9de812ffaaf5079c5712dfbf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310e66da56b7448e064d8276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピー、バレンタイン……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c530cb51953744d793f8a8708d71ce1db23b55799e183d91e1fd1bcf721c8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3f9d2beeaa6a5c6659861a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸说累的时候就要吃甜食，\r\n所以要吃黑糖红豆馅蜜。\r\n但我也想吃圣代或蛋糕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba163dc1b47239e9aa66cd05a30bfd33a9b8737207ef05732f529e92df35bc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48f2f81bcf649fea1b5bd32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尊敬的对象？当然是祖母！\r\n她是伟大的魔女，\r\n而且总是温柔地对我展露笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "447edd1abcbdc5c78952583d8f42019af5453a7445a676bf96694cfb1b9a3267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e95cf77638ad3e47f9f4189",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北部总是替周围的人\r\n带来许多欢笑。\r\n她有成为一个好魔女的资质！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42320308c83dfe57326b4779a37513d45e3b6b6540a72b664dd9ffe213252d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b3693b694f85f811cad480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次想熬夜时，\r\n都会被富士阻挠！\r\n明明有些魔法只能在晚上用～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed50f85edac53c55327987daea1a2be6690f27f79c80d5f1fa3567e3463148d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7790c5594f40bc1b2ddd4443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不想早起，\r\n但这个星期天是特例！\r\n我要和川上一起去看公主战士♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f84f81491a5b3b3055d55a883d6ccecdc065e7df0a5d6bed115092f56b474703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef57d875131a45782c62a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Sweepy的演唱会果然\r\n也要很开心才行！我要向大家\r\n展现魔法，炒热气氛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c24b8e9411d8aaa2584508617941c3f98274162ede21d67161e628a3af38f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e3dce4bbd24efb4b8ebeb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祖母的演唱会也很厉害！\r\n既闪亮又耀眼！\r\n光是看影片就能感觉到很强的魔力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bd5831dc8e924a6538603210aed6251055f2f5009273968c4c7264f5c9b14dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f7c8324d53445502c97edda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，我离伟大的魔女\r\n又更近一步了！Sweepy在获得\r\n决胜服后已经无所畏惧了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde75bd407eb67aa2bb6039528a29d6e2f87c69da86e9760674530292f54627b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68572a1af2467c7a5150d524",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获得专属于我的决胜服后，\r\n就轮到专属于我的魔法了！\r\n我绝对要想出厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77aea78e22ce18e9da4bac115b4587444df6e3a6e754782a20fc62f8fa69b3f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac223b0871d0add707696ba7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使魔，背我去教室！\r\nSweepy早上很难清醒，\r\n你要好好照顾我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03aa6a3355106b323173df32c996f179a44a0ece7bf6e673efda01919796c26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268c11ad5804fd0038036755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说不吃就是不吃！只有青椒\r\n我绝对不吃！那么苦的东西，\r\n怎么可能吃得下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d223bcb90953b9702a899a1ebad3361c0561c5bb4df5e3805967668125927276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58e9cc83e0b6610b2767317",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，去帮我把蝙蝠找回来！\r\n我对它施展了变化魔法，\r\n但后来追丢它了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05db89b4e047db01733294ccc6c6f6a838eb8aefbf8a9876ff9169a18ec5baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df78d3e53930072358f975c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花树蕴含着魔力！\r\n我捡到了一根不错的树枝，\r\n回去后要做成魔法杖♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b764a87f0290c86630b9502b56c7ddd29027ce557a947878290755778d4488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c158b2f73436f9535f1a24e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头好痛……\r\n看来不能吸取太多冰块的魔力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f91da86513fd65732d57f95f647dd0499ef24f306d8d52311fb81485985181c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:689ea6b186e50ef41e643e9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次带我一起去爬山吧！\r\n我想采集很多像枫叶和银杏\r\n这些只有现在采得到的材料！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8606815e0d2507884a3138f6f6a1faee2e3a6b2b51763d1fa0f2601ec8ce3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09aa2a2f4f942700073e9f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等开始积雪后，\r\n就来盖Sweepy的家吧！\r\n你要先做好准备喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a438fc75e0120bab5fbfebd59d5412701a7f2df258d4ba6d0e2631cbb16898e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a535fe9926926c93cca8a3d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヴィルシーナっていっつもクール\r\nなのに、妹の前だとデレデレなのよ\r\n…どんな魔法をかけられてるの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e128a30924f30c6a0209c78c5a00f193e77077b4c9168b037fd2052725fdb419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a6ba41d362beb39d863ddaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…オルフェにこの衣装を見せたら、\r\n『で？余に一体何を求む？』\r\nですって！もー！なんなのアイツ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb7349e6dcced5d16a1cfe553dd70340c18f85dcd9b568db1d1d2ec854b0ef7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4fa648e058ee1656047f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使い魔～！昨日、どうしてLANE\r\n返さなかったのよ！…また残業！？\r\nもう明日からがんばるの禁止っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bce9d34356bfb9ca99f7739f64bfb344a7a3680c43dd5cc4d146836697e13b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:650ea8a9ccb2c6bf88978187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングから、キングコールってやつ\r\nを教わったんだけど…あれはなんの\r\n呪文なの？…まさか大魔法っ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c83c3f947addb2704c36fd6a7e80936c3bd4d51a751752621b75b9784f944b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c91f91b134925c992471f28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシのこの姿を見たら、パパが\r\n泣きだしちゃって…へんなパパ。\r\n泣くんじゃなくてほめなさいよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cdd2187bf09c540b4138b5ea521ac436c6e9862956f360adf46407ff701c1cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50bcc881884aece2aff4a96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んぅ…。…あ、ね、寝てないわよ？\r\nそれより、たくさんのケーキは…？\r\nあったでしょ…どこにやったのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f32d37d030d35a8a6005e6474f8607f857cfd8d0f41a85a0594e9ca1c3e0fe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfaa4967a7a489431b41b47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェのおばちゃんが、大人は好き\r\n嫌いしないもんだって…大人でも\r\nトマトとか苦手な人いるじゃない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65e8ed6cdeb803ee571a710e9f38677e491316237e44249af260bc84f571403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37aa63ad9849501f994b9be6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知ってる？お月さまにはすごい\r\nパワーがあるのよ！いまなら、\r\n難しい魔法だって成功するかも♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed72576628ef74fc6ece88c9e1c22d3934e5872068104563b948781c7cac75e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e529099ee2018cd2464711b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プリーザ☆ブルーラ♪桜よ、\r\n永久に咲き続けろ～！…よし。\r\nこれでいつでも、お花見し放題ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68ba1fd4ac985375bb43eb78e2f09155d10f0a82f4f1b3b0ae3eff976f0a5ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3600fb7394c6b2c66d89213",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かき氷のシロップが、ぜんぶ同じ味\r\nだなんてウソよね？ウソでしょっ？\r\nもしかして魔法がかかってるの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57944692d5238a993f49a320f0bfc14366b29d0c89f9147b0f97163648a0e332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dda2f34e7706d8ea70c7b90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サンマって、骨がたくさんあって\r\n食べにくい～！も～、骨取って！\r\nじゃないと食べないからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58da7ba95f81b340b50409ab40f52e482bb663f048e39211ff3af8ca8e226fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644fd93b9117b48469b2a924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そうだ！アンタも、素敵なお洋服を\r\nサンタに頼みなさい！お揃いのほう\r\nが、魔女と使い魔っぽいでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b788ea2144610177c13e3e979f611186253e6abea494527ef689aa7d7802ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d35d075c92e6af7e6d9d22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふん♪素敵でしょ、このドレス！\r\nどう思った？…魔女みたい？\r\nほら、もっといっぱいほめなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03089cc5d9cd0c72b9d669a000ec2fb6130bfaad7b5dc3214fa6c5bda171e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a4589f9f50bbc7ba849ea26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これを着ると魔力がすっごくアップ\r\nするのよ！試しに…ビリア☆\r\nブーゲン！アタシの虜になぁれ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c94c6213aefd812c7a0ac31ae02fff0eda39ca09a04b6c2562bbc6e9054fbb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e6e42bd31c12f29cb34358c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真的是魔法修行吗？\r\n如果你敢骗我，\r\n我绝对不会放过你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f48d7f67fd3296b55f1fd8f8b45d11856c8a9544e85f96874cbc1281a75d515",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f065dc9f8023a262f16a0d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってやるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b239c08597c143b968b7a7f6745d09ff8a99fa7fd96a961465ac4ce8293cce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b1d0de332f4150208c9bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果很开心我就会奉陪。\r\n但我腻了就会回去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f2d4b8ec50ac1aca7975e4102c69815f7bbb4f70feb970baa8bcc3d7de373a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a0b30748a3eca3d2548723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "异果异果・异果菊☆\r\n哼哼～这样就准备万全了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5567bd3f2a2726728065d6a373edf2ec984ec618800ad5d55cac7afa2cde542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c338c20cafb1e69d3940e18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是天才魔法少女。\r\n我很快就会把训练全部做完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c68c403d6fe4f49bdf5f8684023fc10ad032f388ecfbbd4a485eac2b5b937aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dba392696f59f15543ec8e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近好像开始觉得跑步很开心了。\r\n说不定我离成为魔女\r\n又更近一步了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f014972967ee8498d50a099ac68dd87d44ed5770676298cf813a2cbd44ba8358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e30f481b4ef858ac22328a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然你都这样拜托我了，\r\n那我就稍微努力一下吧！\r\n你要感谢我喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c8c009d76b03fb22a89b92f7e38f1f5f784b1cf02522ea26664d227d8c6730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6227e4e8d84e63d6ddd89e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也配合你训练吧！\r\n你要一直称赞我，\r\n给我很多奖励喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "882df8c01d19e99e8a213290638f3813d31f4cae3392c9849bc7fb3ad3b4d8d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7e8b95f116783da328b8ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌讨厌～！\r\nSweepy想去海边玩！\r\n去──海──边──啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e97ca826901b811d86a88a5498bc6bb3165d35de50eb373f88eb5facb8450f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d25dbc4d6c7cc2853f4706c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニング、ちゃーんと\r\n見てなさい？まばたきなんか\r\nしてたら、見逃しちゃうんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b28bdbd17cdbfea9a242991b40bc33a6da7343550d678e803b7b47a10f86711",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af192ac5416e8dba68da4e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はこれでトレーニングするから\r\n服が汚れないメニューにしなさい！\r\nちょっとでも汚れたら怒るからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde2d3500d2c6c46a1d35feef695a39cb6b1c24bf761132c66d375dc488edc8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6133e419739e62b08eb70b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このドレスの力で、もっともーっと\r\n大きい魔法が使えるはず！\r\nさあ、試すわよ使い魔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c655e4ba2c30c336c4608c57369093d62b5abf0bbc177eb9e519374c1a65347",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3e05c97803ba16ae465209c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あとで甘い飲みもの買って！あと、\r\nお菓子も！…約束できる？なら、\r\nやる気を出してあげてもいいわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "323a8802979dd4cabd952a2ba5da57cb39a7d71f8880a91de92c30e16007cf90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90f075f55d333d0b64803ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つまんないもの、ぜんぶ\r\n変えてやるわ！魔法って、\r\nそのためにあるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b34a5741ca006a400354cdffa39e1c96c3aa6d2d98c714256d56a09ea807180",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d973355abf2977414cf819d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使い魔、なんかアドバイスある？\r\nどーしようもない意見だったら\r\n聞いてなんてあげないけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ab4f65348e6c843163b3bc0074a48b3dc94b4ce54f4a8c8926fb54efc6dfed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc1f8c31870b65d638c06a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタはずっと、アタシに尽くし\r\nなさい！そしたら、アタシも――\r\nちょっとは、期待に応えてあげる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbaa6ede9cfe54aca6ad4670355b5dfad15ecb10041736e5bd0fbc4524968f35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b8505b6df98ad758dd5f7a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你变得可靠了呢。身为我的使魔，\r\n这是理所当然的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b4701972c53c234883c6714dbc37c5c0f42d0d3baee60b17ff751c59605e802",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f859b92ee5ba1f9ba7eb617",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今后也要好好看Sweepy\r\n大显身手！知道了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ee6c0083fb3da46d546e325a10924c602e68e67ba9582c31c4edf3e4f73b3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6988d734fe45c4e735b4260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからもずっと、隣にいなさい！\r\nこれは命令だからねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1099baa1aba8309289636b8fafc5b394843914aa33b1e76375631983db3531e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fbebfe021ea4fc946acb761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタも、ちょっとは使い魔らしく\r\nなったんじゃない？ちょっとだけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12babec7896ba4a9e3aab366a65da2dbe21e4d9d0f0099102a99f379d29b90cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f8cbd880af79a94827b746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉魔力提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd2f8d453cd24cf19a5cd5e3efc82538a85708151372e4b700d88368731385d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f71501833a2b09e985130c80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究极魔法・花朵盛开！\r\n绽放吧，天赋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a610b082ace3f6cb38c8a617a67894ff71b16b40c6966da303439b041256f4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7137bcab18d3d67e2fccc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是天才魔法少女东商变革！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea1fd5a03efabf6d35e863dc44b67e9b9ae8966155aeab4e321d0d740edd01d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad7c58f6293a463ad90db24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\n我会让你见识到厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b79d048f9b0789d01411bdf11682745f87ab10816fcffff4b2fbe2e5bfa2b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a705997b92cee9286a10ef18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辅助魔法就交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc470815415f5637dc78f34445d699e8eb1784b48e32bbfce3655c42cb86753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1352407f2e0830a4da6e44f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来是时候使用秘术了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "109c18b8596a37ceed913b8a8eaf5f17eb60017a9b711c572bcf700aec4e92df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2e81fa4ca7823971e98b33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成長したアタシに、祝福の鐘を鳴らしなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fe02dc0eca4d377e606836f0626f19eb50fa70856f2a4493cd168b151014e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea001346ac45d14596b9b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔女としての、新たな門出ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd358c58f5d54b0899dce870b4231148695d43d5352bafbc0237325366c5bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b000114a475945dab73e05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら！さっさとエスコートして！\r\n特別な魔法、見つけに行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab88b055ab290ac1844d2a5252897e88ca7132bbf77ae49be1065132e048783b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5b70b7f627a80b6cbfa7185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スイープトウショウよ！\r\nしっかりついてきなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e43ab116f8f88c27969542fed5ec8adf47a8c5aaa1c77d1670feb4b7a5c9090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bd045913089e6b352e2367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要为我加油哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d752149f017c02cb05b0d2cf683f295b0f3c33b194cd4f725459d03f661e83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5648ff3cf3756d61a48f6d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，你一定能成为\r\n很了不起的训练员的。\r\n……我的直觉算是蛮准的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ecd3947396dde38d35c7cbf6370215c2115ece82782e9267daac6bc7bbc3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a688b1f3d6d67c8bebad0bcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきますね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf96d14d41756bc31913d185718019d646d025c1f2641ac0b41d828a17930ff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e2d69b605f96f6f2630493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1819a5f4c012a54f288e2c49a94fb4a80a14213f846aac1204b77a584a18e38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "100001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
